@startuml
title Student Ordering Main Flow — Activity DRAFT
start
:Browse active merchants and listed items;
:Search, sort or filter catalog as needed;
:Select available items and valid options;
:Add items to cart;
:Edit quantities, options or notes as needed;
if (Ready to submit?) then (yes)
  :Sign in as student;
  :Set pickup time for each merchant suborder;
  :Revalidate merchant, item, option and same-day future pickup time;
  :Check quantity-mode totals and manual-mode sellable status;
  if (Any validation fails?) then (yes)
    :Show reason and retain cart;
    stop
  else (no)
    if (Base price, option surcharge or fixed discount changed?) then (yes)
      :Show updated breakdown and total;
      if (Student confirms updated amount?) then (yes)
      else (no)
        :Retain cart;
        stop
      endif
    endif
    :Atomically create one order and one suborder per merchant and deduct quantity-mode stock;
    if (Atomic operation succeeds?) then (yes)
      :Return parent order ID;
      :Clear cart;
      if (Same confirmed submission is retried?) then (yes)
        :Return the same result without another order or stock deduction;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Create no order, deduct no stock, show reason and retain cart;
    endif
  endif
else (no)
  :Continue browsing or editing cart;
endif
stop

note right
  Requirements: FR-03–FR-05, FR-11–FR-25
  Amount-change confirmation covers base price, option surcharge and fixed discount (FR-23).
  Declining the changed amount retains the cart and stops submission.
end note
@enduml
